Reboot the linux
Press E

The word stars with linux , in the end change into =====> rw quiet splash init=/bin/bash ====> press CTRL+X

After that get the root terminal.

ROOT password and User password can be changed with passwd
$passwd root
$passwd user

But can also use sed to change those passwords.

$cat /etc/passwd | head -n 1
$sed -i "1s/.*/root:$(mkpasswd victor):0:0:root:\/root:\/usr\/bin\/zsh/" /etc/passwd
